  "body": "## Summary\n- advance the workout model to Synergy 17 with a dedicated Day 15 shoulder press session\n- turn Day 14 into a deliberately light shoulder primer and shift Grip/Hips to Days 16/17\n- add ADR-style decision records for program and architecture rationale\n- regenerate the anonymous SQLite snapshot and update cycle/soreness presentation\n- make standalone migration commands load local environment configuration and retry only newly pending migrations in dry-run verification\n\n## Verification\n- `cd backend \u0026\u0026 npm run migrate:dry-run` (live-data preview; safe to retry)\n- `cd frontend \u0026\u0026 npm run lint` (0 errors; 11 existing hook warnings)\n- `cd frontend \u0026\u0026 npm run build`\n- `node scripts/check-removed-msal.mjs`\n- `node scripts/check-image-fingerprint-config.mjs`\n- production-preview visual check of the 17-day cycle",
  "changed_files": 12,
